    {
      "name": "Real-Time Tracking (Socket.IO /location)",
      "description": "Real-time location streaming and driver proximity awareness engine running on Socket.IO namespace /location. In Postman, open New -> WebSocket / Socket.IO Request, set URL to {{wsUrl}}, configure Handshake Auth { token: \"{{userToken}}\" }, and enable [x] Ack.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Socket.IO Connection & Handshake Guide",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/redis",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health", "redis"]
            },
            "description": "### How to Connect in Postman:\n1. Click **New** in top-left -> Select **WebSocket Request** -> Select **Socket.IO**.\n2. **URL**: `{{baseUrl}}/location` (or `ws://localhost:3030/location`).\n3. Under **Events / Auth (Handshake)**, add:\n```json\n{\n  \"token\": \"{{userToken}}\"\n}\n```\n4. Click **Connect**.\n5. You will receive `location:config` pace rules immediately."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Event: location:update (Telemetry Ping)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"lat\": 12.9716,\n  \"lng\": 77.5946,\n  \"speed\": 45.0,\n  \"heading\": 90.0,\n  \"accuracy\": 10.0,\n  \"journeyId\": 7,\n  \"clientTimestamp\": 1793014500000\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journeys/active",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "journeys", "active"]
            },
            "description": "### Socket.IO Event: `location:update`\nIn your Postman Socket.IO request:\n1. Event Name: `location:update`\n2. Check **[x] Ack** box to see server response.\n3. Send payload:\n```json\n{\n  \"lat\": 12.9716,\n  \"lng\": 77.5946,\n  \"speed\": 45.0,\n  \"heading\": 90.0,\n  \"accuracy\": 10.0,\n  \"journeyId\": 7,\n  \"clientTimestamp\": 1793014500000\n}\n```\n4. Server responds with acknowledgement `{ \"receivedAt\": 1793014500000, \"timestamp\": 1793014500000 }`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Event: location:heartbeat (Stationary Ping)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"clientTimestamp\": 1793014500000\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "### Socket.IO Event: `location:heartbeat`\nSent every 45s when stationary (speed <= 0.5 m/s) to keep session alive without sending full coordinates:\n```json\n{\n  \"clientTimestamp\": 1793014500000\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Event: location:mode (Switch Transport Mode)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mode\": \"CYCLIST\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/transport-mode",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "transport-mode"]
            },
            "description": "### Socket.IO Event: `location:mode`\nSwitches user mode on the active socket stream (`DRIVER`, `CYCLIST`, `WALKER`):\n```json\n{\n  \"mode\": \"CYCLIST\"\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
